## 6. Git & docs
- Identity {{GIT_IDENTITY}}; remote {{REMOTE}}; default branch {{DEFAULT_BRANCH}}.
- Feature branches from {{BASE_BRANCH}}; push once when the feature is ready; the agent opens the PR and merges it
  into {{BASE_BRANCH}} once the gate is green on the merged head (no review step); a production merge or
  release waits for the developer's go.
- Keep the KB current in the **same change** as the code.

## 7. For the owner
State the change in chat; the assistant runs the workflow in §3 end to end and reports a change done only
after the real check (before it: "implemented and green" plus what is left). It asks only when a decision is
genuinely yours; otherwise it makes a reasoned assumption and records it.
